        "accession_number": "0001062822-26-000050",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we are entitled to receive clinical and regulatory milestone payments ranging, depending on the timing and extent of our efforts in the alliance, up to $76 million for each drug developed by Bristol-Myers Squibb under the alliance.",
