        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Instead, we have multiple contractual agreements in place with third-party contract manufacturing organizations, or CMOs, who, on our behalf, manufacture commercial supplies of INPEFA and clinical supplies of our drug candidates, and will continue to do so for the foreseeable future.",
